and adjust it to suit the texture that you want.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:30.800
Nobody likes sandy textured ice cream so don't&nbsp;
give me a load of BS " that's how you like it"&nbsp;

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:37.680
Next question is: My ice cream melts too fast?&nbsp;
melting ice cream ..... ice cream melts, it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:43.840
made of ice.... ice melts..... if it's melting too&nbsp;
fast it's because there's too much free water in&nbsp;&nbsp;

